# Recorded footage of real people.
#
# The keypoint tracks (.npz) are shared: they are skeleton coordinates, they
# are what the evaluation actually uses, and they identify nobody. The video
# the clips were cut from stays on the machine that recorded it - this is a
# public repository, and nobody should have to publish footage of themselves
# to contribute training data.
dataset/**/*.mp4

# Saved evaluation runs are local scratch, not project history.
dataset/_results/
